# Density Compare
# Mercury (Hg) — real density 13.534 g/cm³. equal masses: Mercury vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Mercury Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 8.4mm material: mercury at (-20mm, 4.2mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 107.9 g — the water cube is the reference
